  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>1%+ lower rates + instant prequals for your buyers</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Today&#x27;s live rates — averaging 1–1.5% lower, same closing costs.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0BFF56\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/gorealo-logo.png\" alt=\"GoRealo\" width=\"154\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a></p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#003FDA;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">FOR NORTHEAST FLORIDA REALTORS</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 8px;color:#162849\">Lower rates. Instant prequals. Stronger offers.</h1></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">Hi {{first_name}},</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">In this rate environment, a full percentage point can be the difference between a buyer who can write a strong offer and one who can&rsquo;t.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">Our rates currently average <strong>1&ndash;1.5% lower</strong> than most competitors &mdash; <strong>with the same closing costs</strong>. A 1% lower rate typically creates roughly <strong>40% more eligible buyers</strong> (stronger purchasing power + better DTI qualification).</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">We&rsquo;ve been helping Northeast Florida buyers and agents since <strong>1998</strong>.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px;background:#ffffff\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 8px;color:#162849\">Here&rsquo;s today&rsquo;s live rate snapshot</h2></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid #e5eaf1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\"><tr style=\"background:#f4f6f9\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#667085;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px\">Loan Type</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#667085;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px\">Interest Rate</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#667085;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px\">APR</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#162849;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">FHA <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0BFF56;color:#162849;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;vertical-align:middle\">BEST</span></td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#15803d;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">5.990%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#003FDA;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">6.714%</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#162849;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">VA <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0BFF56;color:#162849;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;vertical-align:middle\">BEST</span></td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#15803d;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">5.990%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#003FDA;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">6.405%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#162849;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">USDA</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#15803d;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">6.125%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#003FDA;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">7.011%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#162849;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">Conventional</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#15803d;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">6.750%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#003FDA;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">7.050%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#162849;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">Jumbo</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#15803d;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">6.875%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#003FDA;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\">7.160%</td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#98a2b3;margin:10px 0 0\">Mortgage interest rates shown are based on a 780 credit score with 20% down payment or equity. FHA, VA, and USDA rates may vary slightly for different credit profiles. Last updated Nov 13, 2026.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">These are our current 30-year purchase rates (as of Nov 13, 2026) &mdash; starting at <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">5.990%</strong>.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 8px;color:#162849\">Want to make it even easier?</h2></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Download our free realtor app for <strong>instant prequalifications</strong> with real rates, accurate closing costs, and cash-to-close estimates you can share with buyers on the spot.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:18px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"mailto:jim@gorealo.com?subject=Realtor%20app%20link\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Get the free realtor app link</a></td></tr></table></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px;background:#ffffff\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Just reply or text me if you&rsquo;d like the app link, a quick rate quote, or help with a specific buyer. Happy to make the process simple for you and your clients.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#162849;margin:22px 0 0\"><strong>Jim Hammond</strong><br>Senior Loan Originator | NMLS 190210<br>EquiFund Mortgage / GoRealo<br><a href=\"mailto:jim@gorealo.com\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">jim@gorealo.com</a><br><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">www.gorealo.com</a> | <a href=\"https://www.equifundmortgage.com\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">www.equifundmortgage.com</a></p></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">GoRealo&reg; is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 &middot; Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Privacy</a> &middot; <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "1%+ lower rates + instant prequals for your buyers Today's live rates — averaging 1–1.5% lower, same closing costs.\n\n MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR\n\n FOR NORTHEAST FLORIDA REALTORS\n\n Lower rates. Instant prequals. Stronger offers.\n\n Hi {{first_name}},\n In this rate environment, a full percentage point can be the difference between a buyer who can write a strong offer and one who can’t.\n Our rates currently average 1–1.5% lower than most competitors — with the same closing costs . A 1% lower rate typically creates roughly 40% more eligible buyers (stronger purchasing power + better DTI qualification).\n We’ve been helping Northeast Florida buyers and agents since 1998 .\n\n Here’s today’s live rate snapshot\n\n Loan Type Interest Rate APR \n FHA BEST 5.990% 6.714% \n VA BEST 5.990% 6.405% \n USDA 6.125% 7.011% \n Conventional 6.750% 7.050% \n Jumbo 6.875% 7.160% \n Mortgage interest rates shown are based on a 780 credit score with 20% down payment or equity. FHA, VA, and USDA rates may vary slightly for different credit profiles. Last updated Nov 13, 2026.\n\n These are our current 30-year purchase rates (as of Nov 13, 2026) — starting at 5.990% .\n\n Want to make it even easier?\n\n Download our free realtor app for instant prequalifications with real rates, accurate closing costs, and cash-to-close estimates you can share with buyers on the spot.\n\n Get the free realtor app link \n\n Just reply or text me if you’d like the app link, a quick rate quote, or help with a specific buyer. Happy to make the process simple for you and your clients.\n Jim Hammond \nSenior Loan Originator | NMLS 190210\nEquiFund Mortgage / GoRealo\n jim@gorealo.com \n www.gorealo.com | www.equifundmortgage.com \n\n GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.\n5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.\nEqual Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.\n Privacy · Unsubscribe",
